e-different). Forward-applicable to every replay/recording invariant: assert on bytes, not parsed structures, when the contract is byte-identical determinism. Burst sizing: replayWorkers=4 × replayIterationsPerWorker=8 = 32 concurrent retries per run, enough to surface a non-deterministic recorder under -race without bloating CI wall-clock. The runtime burst observes per-iteration {status, body, header} and asserts post-burst aggregation in the main goroutine (no testing.T calls from workers — same shape as BE-0392's burst pattern).
